{"id":"memoria","lemma":"memoria","pos":"noun","rank":959,"glosses":["memory (the ability of the brain to record information)","memory (a specific thing that is remembered)","report, document"],"ipa":"/meˈmoɾja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"memorias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-memoria.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su buena memoria es su arma.","en":"A good memory is his weapon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705000","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"weapon, arm"}]},{"text":"Mi hermano tiene buena memoria.","en":"My brother has a good memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767771","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]},{"text":"Tienes una memoria bastante buena.","en":"You have a pretty good memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599276","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"quite"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"}]},{"text":"Me gustaría tener mejor memoria.","en":"I wish I had a better memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553578","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"better"},null]},{"text":"Me lo sé de memoria.","en":"I know it by heart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450010","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}